{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"111475","commit":"a18846c3a374cc8f6c18bf9cab43a4d807de4d66","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"I have reviewed all the changes in this chapter. The modifications primarily focus on improving the handling of union types (ambiguous field mappings) by allowing them to propagate through certain analysis phases and providing more descriptive \"Unsupported\" errors instead of generic \"Unresolved\" errors when they cannot be resolved.\nThe refactoring in `Analyzer.ResolveRefs#resolveStats` (#0X6BJ) correctly simplifies the collection of resolved attributes, and the updates to `TypeResolutions` (#ETZGN, #FS04S) properly implement the logic for validating union types against predicates. The removal of redundant re-resolution logic in `Analyzer.ResolveUnionTypes` (#33B14) is consistent with the expanded scope of `UnionTypesCleanup` (#E7TTX).\nNo logical errors or performance issues were identified.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-54898:55012,55025:55098,55111:56096-","promptId":"#33B14","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":54898,"endPos":55012,"startLine":1123,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":1123,"endLineOffset":126,"length":115},{"pos":55025,"endPos":55098,"startLine":1124,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":1124,"endLineOffset":85,"length":74},{"pos":55111,"endPos":56096,"startLine":1125,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":1139,"endLineOffset":13,"length":986}],"dstChanges":[]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql-core/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/core/expression/TypeResolutions.java-x-pack/plugin/esql-core/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/core/expression/TypeResolutions.java-6817:7403-6883